      "meta": null,
      "orig": "**Find a PM buddy (or two) —**Build a strong relationship with a successful PM at the company. Ask them to give you the inside scoop on how things get done, who you should get to know, and what it takes to be successful. If you’re the first PM in the org, then find a peer in a different function.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/3"
